# Taaladvies.net, the joint advice service of the Nederlandse Taalunie, the
# Instituut voor de Nederlandse Taal and Genootschap Onze Taal. Its whole
# subject is correct Dutch, which is what makes a typographic finding in its
# own prose worth reading - the same argument that qualifies fundeu-rae-es,
# and it lands harder here because two of this pack's rules cite this site.
#
# Measured before it was declared: 300 posts, no straight apostrophe and no
# straight double quote anywhere in them. That is the bar a corpus has to
# clear, since text somebody set badly measures recall, which nobody doubts.
#
# Post ids are frozen into the query, so this list is a fixed set of articles
# rather than "whatever is on the front page today". Taken in date order and
# blind to what any of them says: picking advice pages by whether they quote
# anything would make the quotation counts a property of the picking.
# Frozen 2026-08-15. format: wp-json
#
# No second column: the archive holds no capture of these API URLs, which is
# what an archive crawler not following a `wp-json` query looks like. This
# corpus is always fetched live; the frozen post ids fix the set.
